      "data": {
        "text": "**Developing Metric Implementation**\n\nI've just finished the initial setup for retrieving aggregate metric statistics using Google Cloud Monitoring. The core functionality is implemented in `aggregate_metric_stats.py`, which is based on the `google.cloud.monitoring_v3` library, employing `monitoring_v3.MetricServiceClient`. I've ensured the necessary imports are in place, so the provider can be identified, and the client class is ready to go.\n\n\n**Confirming Code Completion**\n\nThe `aggregate_metric_stats.py` script is fully implemented now. I've added instructions on authentication and library installation in the comments. The file incorporates the necessary imports, and client setup, with placeholders for project ID and metric type ready for the next phase. I am satisfied I have completed all required aspects of the task, and will move to testing.\n\n\n",
