    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Metric Provider**\n\nI've decided to use Google Cloud Monitoring as the data provider and will ensure its integration is clearly defined within the Python script, `query_metric_window.py`. I'm focusing on making the provider selection explicit in the code.\n\n\n**Implementing the Query Script**\n\nI'm now fully immersed in the coding phase, building the `query_metric_window.py` script. The Google Cloud Monitoring client is instantiated, and I've integrated the necessary placeholders for user input: project ID, metric type, and the time window. I'm focusing on ensuring the script is functional and that it makes clear to the user the project ID is required, the metric type is required, and the time window start and end are required.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789861450727,
          "start": 1789861447000
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc0e4558001FbVnnxZfvxIZN1",
